      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此……！\n那么对支持度较高的赛马娘来说，\n外侧反而比较有利呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe62714cc0e374949ddee17666262c4d3e68fce60f4f1dd127a6a56eb6a2804",
