      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那时我突然灵光一闪。\n这点──或许能够活用在\n里见皇冠的比赛对策上！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e9e0a60e6547535602b9f214be55112016f3104222303fbdb755dce32e90cc",
