    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2797fcf4d74c355ad1ad5c6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就来整理一下吧，你提议的，\n若我没抽到最外侧闸位时的对策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "868b1efa9c6b4678b2256de2dd2c202715a2bb706ba48aa3e034601b1cd80555",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:590f2df1edc90ff6aa359a71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了防止「过弯造成的损失」，\n赛马娘们会在比赛中争夺\n最接近围栏的位置。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1baebd88fa869006899e39e8f789850b5c063f70ac0f37a56b941f43659e9639",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3e9a88aa289f9b225425f8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以实际数字来看，假设在德比场地东京赛场，\n有人沿着距离内侧围栏3米处跑一圈──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a9dfc7c488058175b70575c348c35c3eade5192aca194875e2a9c847aac070e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27e5d4fc765aa724b297cf03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "换算成身距差，就是大约7身距",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd152900ca15dc7514492c438e821f2842579841ca182d10988a8e77bf49478f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
